{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37768","headline":"九日偶怀寄左省张起居 · 郑谷","name":"九日偶怀寄左省张起居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"令节争欢我独闲，荒台尽日向晴山。\n浑无酒泛金英菊，漫道官趋玉笋班。\n深愧青莎迎野步，不堪红叶照衰颜。\n羡君官重多吟兴，醉带南陂落照还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}